 "brief": "The Palestinian Ahrar Movement strongly condemned an Israeli military strike on a police and security center in Gaza City, calling it a massacre, according to Shehab Wire. The faction said the attack demonstrates flagrant disregard for ceasefire commitments and accused Prime Minister Netanyahu of prioritizing electoral considerations over civilian lives.\n\nAhrar charged that international silence has emboldened Israeli operations. The group argued that without diplomatic pressure, the military operations will continue unabated, framing global inaction as tacit approval of what it characterized as crimes against Palestinians in Gaza.",
